    "https://ntu.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/NTU-Main-Campus-Singapore/Research-Associate--Geotechnical-Engineering-Environmental-Engineering-_R00025663": {
      "title": "Research Associate (Geotechnical Engineering/Environmental Engineering)",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-09-02\nPosted: Posted 7 Days Ago\nFull time\n\nThe School of Civil and Environmental Engineering (CEE) at Nanyang Technological University is a leading school for Sustainable Built Environment. It has over 60 faculty members and more than 1,500 students and is rapidly expanding its range of education and research activities. We are looking for a Research Associate to conduct life-cycle assessment on solid waste treatment and management systems. Key Responsibilities:  Design and conduct experimental investigations on coastal and riverine solid waste systems; Develop and apply mechanistic and data-driven models, integrated with life-cycle assessment (LCA). Job Requirements: Master’s degree in Geotechnical Engineering, Environmental Engineering or related field At least 1 year of relevant experience in life-cycle assessment Familiarity with related literature and software Good written and oral communication skills Entry level candidates are welcome to apply We regret to inform that only shortlisted candidates will be notified.   Hiring Institution: NTU"
